Tree mode: comparisons
use complete files
before and after each
commit.

═══════════════════════
*    DELTA DIFFERENCES*
═══════════════════════
Signs mark edits made
by only that patch. A
sign-less line with one
number is an edit both
patches make: a new
number means both add
it, an old number means
both remove it.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 old new│so┃ old new│so
        │lo┃        │lo
        │@@┃        │@@
        │ a┃        │ a
   1   1│a ┃-  1    │a
+      2│X ┃        │

═══════════════════════
*  CONTEXT DIFFERENCES*
═══════════════════════
Signs mark lines
present in only one
result: - patch1, +
patch2.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
     new│so┃     new│so
        │lo┃        │lo
        │@@┃        │@@
        │ a┃        │
-      1│a ┃        │
-      2│X ┃        │
